; No ppx and no inline_tests on production code, matching the asm/ split.
;
; No enabled_if: unlike every stanza under asm/, this needs no Melange guard.
; The guards there exist because asm/vendor/err_trace is disabled under
; Melange; this project's own copy is not, and nothing here builds to JS.
;
; `fmt` is deliberately absent: Tool_error.pp needs only Format. `cmdliner` is
; named by bin/dune rather than here, which is exactly why a dependency audit
; has to read executables as graph roots and not just libraries.
;
; digestif.ocaml, never bare `digestif`: the backend is a pinned decision, not
; an alternation resolved at build time. digestif.c would add a host-C build to
; the make asm-build path on every platform leg, including linux/i386 and
; linux/arm/v7.

(library
 (name compcert_tools)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries err_trace bos fpath digestif.ocaml mtime.clock.os unix))
